# Reference: fixed-entrypoints solution.
#
# The level has already placed both entrypoints;
# this solution only places the arm
# and carries the spawned molecule onto the exit.
#
# This is solution.
# The level is defined in `examples/40_fixed_delivery.oml`.

# Arm at (3,3); rotation 0 -> hand at (2,4).
place arm 3 3                       # id 4

# Grab the molecule, swing it four steps onto the exit, then release.
action 4 1 grab
action 4 2 rotate_clw
action 4 3 rotate_clw
action 4 4 rotate_clw
action 4 5 rotate_clw
action 4 6 release
